{"4845040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brews & Kings", "steam_appid": 4845040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a brewmaster with a royal permit. Build a city where every field, road, and building serves one industry. Turn a wilderness into a beer economy strong enough to keep the King happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/5e0bf24942b29d7a193f26ea4ffe5b09.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/5e0bf24942b29d7a193f26ea4ffe5b09.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/5e0bf24942b29d7a193f26ea4ffe5b09.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King is fickle, and a new one sits on the throne each run. One wants quantity and forgives almost anything if the barrels arrive on time. Another cares about appearance and expects your city to look rich. Each King changes what a good strategy looks like before you place a single building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/81d47021b35b228a60dd22a761e78cce.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/81d47021b35b228a60dd22a761e78cce.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/81d47021b35b228a60dd22a761e78cce.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your run around a procedurally generated world full of resources and events. Place buildings, assign workers, and respond to whatever the map sends you. Group related buildings into specialized districts to raise production across the city, and turn a scattered settlement into a city with a purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/101cc443ca8641a706672d8684ba747e.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/101cc443ca8641a706672d8684ba747e.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/101cc443ca8641a706672d8684ba747e.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run ends with one big event. A royal festival that demands more beer in one season than you normally brew in five. A hard winter that freezes your fields and stops your gathering. A spirit that looms over your city and drains your population until you find a way to satisfy it. You know it is coming from the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/ab6adc2155b4e2a57da0a9d5c87a6a28.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/ab6adc2155b4e2a57da0a9d5c87a6a28.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/ab6adc2155b4e2a57da0a9d5c87a6a28.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run leaves you with more than you started with. New buildings, new events, and new merchants join the world. Then you place your first foundation on fresh ground, under a new King, and begin again.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a brewmaster with a royal permit. Build a city where every field, road, and building serves one industry. Turn a wilderness into a beer economy strong enough to keep the King happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/5e0bf24942b29d7a193f26ea4ffe5b09.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/5e0bf24942b29d7a193f26ea4ffe5b09.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/5e0bf24942b29d7a193f26ea4ffe5b09.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King is fickle, and a new one sits on the throne each run. One wants quantity and forgives almost anything if the barrels arrive on time. Another cares about appearance and expects your city to look rich. Each King changes what a good strategy looks like before you place a single building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/81d47021b35b228a60dd22a761e78cce.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/81d47021b35b228a60dd22a761e78cce.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/81d47021b35b228a60dd22a761e78cce.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your run around a procedurally generated world full of resources and events. Place buildings, assign workers, and respond to whatever the map sends you. Group related buildings into specialized districts to raise production across the city, and turn a scattered settlement into a city with a purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/101cc443ca8641a706672d8684ba747e.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/101cc443ca8641a706672d8684ba747e.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/101cc443ca8641a706672d8684ba747e.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run ends with one big event. A royal festival that demands more beer in one season than you normally brew in five. A hard winter that freezes your fields and stops your gathering. A spirit that looms over your city and drains your population until you find a way to satisfy it. You know it is coming from the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/ab6adc2155b4e2a57da0a9d5c87a6a28.poster.avif?t=1788165593\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/ab6adc2155b4e2a57da0a9d5c87a6a28.webm?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/extras/ab6adc2155b4e2a57da0a9d5c87a6a28.mp4?t=1788165593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run leaves you with more than you started with. New buildings, new events, and new merchants join the world. Then you place your first foundation on fresh ground, under a new King, and begin again.</p>", "short_description": "A roguelite city builder where you brew for a different king every run. Explore a wilderness that changes each time, raise the farms and mills that turn its ingredients into beer, and build an economy strong enough to satisfy whatever your king demands.", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/03b0d69c31bcc1ae58a9a839d6f82ce6dbd6f744/header.jpg?t=1788165593", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/460f2c978bc5d499024eca0e0259c25de3d1ea45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788165593", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845040/460f2c978bc5d499024eca0e0259c25de3d1ea45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788165593", "website": "https://scarlet.engineering", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2, or x86_32 CPU with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Support for OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recomm